_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe advertised thread-details default change is absent, leaving half of the stated behavior unimplemented.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Thread details remain enabled outside v3 preview](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20511#discussion_r4260952223) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5506393943","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5506393943},{"body":"[Javaagent] The title and description also promise that `otel.javaagent.add-thread-details` becomes default-off independently of v3 preview, but the production path still defaults it with `!v3Preview` in `AgentDistributionConfig.java:237`; without preview, thread details therefore remain enabled. Please either implement that default change with its flat-config coverage and migration note, or remove thread details from this PR's stated scope.","comment_commit_id":"98e13aa63d8bc98cb6cd0f866389893110c5f34d","comment_id":4260952223,"key":"inline:4260952223","kind":"inline","line":9,"original_commit_id":"98e13aa63d8bc98cb6cd0f866389893110c5f34d","original_line":9,"path":"CHANGELOG.md","review_commit_id":"98e13aa63d8bc98cb6cd0f866389893110c5f34d","review_id":5506393943,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-13T15:5